<title>USA: D&amp;P may upgrade Dean Witter, Discover.</title>
<headline>D&amp;P may upgrade Dean Witter, Discover.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Wednesday it placed its ratings for Dean Witter, Discover &amp; Co on rating watch for a possible upgrade on news the company will merge with Morgan Stanley Group Inc.</p>
<p>The credit rating agency currently rates Dean Witter's senior debt single-A-plus and its commercial paper D-one.</p>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps said it believes the combined company will possess certain strategic advantages that could have positive rating implications. Duff &amp; Phelps also expects the merger will produce greater earnings consistency.</p>
<p>Dean Witter shares were up 1-5/8 Wednesday at 40-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
